    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d273">

                <pb facs="0650" n="530" sameAs="frus:frus1922v01/pg530"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.73/229: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Crosby</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rio de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-06-20T13:00:00-03:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 20, 1922—1
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 2:22 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>56. My 44, May 2, 10 a.m.<anchor n="56" xml:id="d273-f1"/> Am unofficially
                    informed by Foreign Office that Brazilian Government accepts resolution
                    presented by Western Telegraph Company on February 7th last<anchor n="57"
                        xml:id="d273-f2"/> and that official confirmation will be sent me in a few
                        days.<anchor n="58" xml:id="d273-f3"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Crosby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d273-f1" n="56" xml:id="d273-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d273-f2" n="57" xml:id="d273-f2-content">
                <p>See telegram no. 13, Feb. 7, from the Ambassador in Brazil, <ref target="#pg524"
                        >p. 524</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d273-f3" n="58" xml:id="d273-f3-content">
                <p>The Chargé was officially informed on June 24 that the Brazilian Government
                    accepted the renunciation of preferential or exclusive rights enjoyed by the
                    Western Telegraph Company in Brazil. The Executive Decree authorizing the
                    renunciation was issued on July 25, 1922.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
